<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:58.280
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:03.240
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:03.240
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:02:14.550 --> 00:02:16.630
W-What?!

00:02:36.240 --> 00:02:37.150
CHAPTER 57

00:02:37.820 --> 00:02:42.120
THE BLOODY NOBLE
LA SIENE

00:02:42.240 --> 00:02:44.680
Did you hear about
the Dracula incidents?

00:02:44.680 --> 00:02:46.440
I saw on the internet.

00:02:46.440 --> 00:02:49.270
Living people got drained
of their blood, right?

00:02:49.270 --> 00:02:52.230
There's been seven cases this month alone.

00:02:52.230 --> 00:02:55.070
Aside from all victims being young women,

00:02:55.070 --> 00:02:58.570
there's nothing in common
like addresses or history.

00:02:58.570 --> 00:03:04.070
They say it's some psycho who enjoys
draining people of blood.

00:03:04.070 --> 00:03:08.290
I hear some people have been
accused online.

00:03:08.680 --> 00:03:12.290
But is it really being done by a human?

00:03:12.290 --> 00:03:15.110
You mean it could be a <i>yokai</i>?

00:03:15.820 --> 00:03:17.420
A <i>yokai</i>...

00:03:17.420 --> 00:03:20.090
Then it might be a vampire.

00:03:20.090 --> 00:03:21.800
What if he's handsome?

00:03:21.800 --> 00:03:23.200
Miyabi...

00:03:29.080 --> 00:03:31.360
Dad, how's the water?

00:03:31.360 --> 00:03:33.520
It's just right.

00:03:34.750 --> 00:03:36.360
So, Kitaro...

00:03:36.360 --> 00:03:38.900
The Four Treasonous Generals, right?

00:03:38.900 --> 00:03:42.340
Has there been word from Kagami-Jijii?

00:03:43.800 --> 00:03:47.960
I'm curious about
that Rei Isurugi's movements, too.

00:03:47.960 --> 00:03:49.100
Yes.

00:03:49.810 --> 00:03:52.100
Kitaro, are you there?

00:03:54.940 --> 00:03:58.170
Hmm. All of their blood drained...

00:03:58.170 --> 00:04:02.090
Could it be another vampire like Elite?

00:04:02.090 --> 00:04:07.830
If so, that's peculiar.
Having vampires appear one after another.

00:04:08.240 --> 00:04:12.850
You don't hear of many <i>yokai</i> in Japan
that drink blood.

00:04:12.850 --> 00:04:16.690
There are <i>yokai</i> that
drain souls or life energy or eat flesh,

00:04:16.690 --> 00:04:21.010
but there aren't many
<i>yokai</i> in Japan that drink blood.

00:04:21.510 --> 00:04:25.080
There's the Nobusuma or Tobikura.

00:04:25.080 --> 00:04:26.700
Oh, but...

00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:32.750
the Nobusuma a man named Ihei captured
long ago only drank cat blood.

00:04:32.750 --> 00:04:38.000
The Odoro-Odoro drank blood,
but it's unlikely it'll show up again.

00:04:38.400 --> 00:04:42.880
So you think it's
a Western <i>yokai</i>'s doing again?

00:04:43.320 --> 00:04:48.390
If they're showing up one after another
there must be some reason.

00:04:48.700 --> 00:04:50.390
Could it be...

00:04:51.500 --> 00:04:53.390
Emergency!

00:04:54.160 --> 00:04:56.790
What's wrong, Sand Witch?

00:05:00.630 --> 00:05:02.910
It's Sand Witch's Sand Link.

00:05:02.910 --> 00:05:04.320
Sand Link?

00:05:04.320 --> 00:05:07.140
It's like a video communication app.

00:05:18.560 --> 00:05:19.960
Agnes?!

00:05:21.690 --> 00:05:23.010
I've missed you!

00:05:23.010 --> 00:05:24.010
Mana!

00:05:29.030 --> 00:05:32.850
I told you! Don't step out of the circle!

00:05:32.850 --> 00:05:36.710
Save your greetings. Explain to Kitaro.

00:05:39.330 --> 00:05:41.320
It's an emergency, Kitaro.

00:05:41.670 --> 00:05:43.860
Backbeard is trying to resurrect.

00:05:43.860 --> 00:05:45.340
What?!

00:05:45.880 --> 00:05:47.320
But, last time...

00:05:56.600 --> 00:06:00.400
Are you sure Backbeard is
trying to resurrect?

00:06:01.480 --> 00:06:03.750
By using human blood.

00:06:03.750 --> 00:06:05.220
What?!

00:06:05.220 --> 00:06:06.490
Dad!

00:06:07.740 --> 00:06:10.990
That might explain the vampiric incidents.

00:06:12.660 --> 00:06:15.270
Elite came to Japan?!

00:06:15.270 --> 00:06:19.520
Could Elite have been
under orders from Backbeard?

00:06:19.520 --> 00:06:21.840
That's possible.

00:06:22.630 --> 00:06:26.650
Carmilla is commanding
vampiric <i>yokai</i> around the world.

00:06:26.650 --> 00:06:29.320
She's telling them to gather human blood.

00:06:29.320 --> 00:06:33.530
Do you have any idea who the vampire
currently in Japan is?

00:06:33.530 --> 00:06:38.330
Asanbosam and Penanggalan
don't leave fang marks...

00:06:38.330 --> 00:06:42.110
A <i>yokai</i> with connections to
Backbeard and Carmilla...

00:06:44.360 --> 00:06:45.420
Could it be...?!

00:06:45.900 --> 00:06:47.670
You know of someone?

00:06:48.110 --> 00:06:51.180
Yes. The vampire, La Seine.

00:06:51.180 --> 00:06:52.700
La Seine?

00:06:53.080 --> 00:06:56.330
If it's him, he'll be worse than Elite.

00:06:56.660 --> 00:06:59.190
He's a vampiric <i>yokai</i> noble.

00:06:59.190 --> 00:07:01.630
So this La Seine is...

00:07:02.790 --> 00:07:06.070
Oh no, the sand is running out of power!

00:07:06.070 --> 00:07:08.030
Wait! How's Adele-san?

00:07:08.380 --> 00:07:12.030
She's fine.
We're getting along well together...

00:07:15.350 --> 00:07:16.470
Dad.

00:07:17.850 --> 00:07:22.170
Backbeard attempting to resurrect
is terrifying enough.

00:07:22.170 --> 00:07:27.550
But if a vampire stronger than Elite
has come to Japan...

00:07:28.070 --> 00:07:30.180
Mana, you should go home.

00:07:30.180 --> 00:07:31.800
I'll take you there.

00:07:31.800 --> 00:07:32.990
Okay.

00:07:38.290 --> 00:07:40.150
Don't worry, Mana.

00:07:40.150 --> 00:07:41.710
I'm here with...

00:07:57.890 --> 00:07:59.500
Tell Kitaro!

00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:01.500
G-Got it!

00:08:05.520 --> 00:08:07.710
What?! Catchick?

00:08:07.710 --> 00:08:11.510
That's right.
Cat-san went after him alone!

00:08:11.510 --> 00:08:12.510
Rollo Cloth!

00:08:12.910 --> 00:08:15.660
What's goin' on?

00:08:16.970 --> 00:08:18.540
Oh, you're ridin'.

00:08:19.200 --> 00:08:22.750
Leave the rest to me! Go home, Mana!

00:08:27.500 --> 00:08:28.730
Kitaro-san!

00:08:30.880 --> 00:08:32.700
Catchick!

00:08:46.650 --> 00:08:48.090
A-fwoop!

00:08:48.090 --> 00:08:51.090
I'll take Catchick for ya!

00:09:02.830 --> 00:09:05.150
You're safe now.

00:09:05.150 --> 00:09:06.810
Hold on just a bit longer.

00:09:07.420 --> 00:09:10.320
La Seine the vampire! You're fighting me!

00:09:10.750 --> 00:09:12.860
I'm La Seine.

00:09:18.220 --> 00:09:20.580
LA SEINE THE VAMPIRE

00:09:22.390 --> 00:09:24.580
LA SEINE THE VAMPIRE

00:09:25.440 --> 00:09:29.080
SAVING RAT MAN!

00:09:27.100 --> 00:09:27.980
-<i>"Oh no..."</i>
-<i>"No passing."</i>

00:09:28.110 --> 00:09:28.980
<i>"You're out!!"</i>

00:09:49.630 --> 00:09:51.440
I'm Mammoth.

00:09:51.440 --> 00:09:55.550
I'm a member of the human family
that serves La Seine-sama.

00:09:58.510 --> 00:10:04.350
I'd heard you were the Japanese <i>yokai</i> that
caused such trouble for Backbeard-sama.

00:10:04.980 --> 00:10:07.120
Is this all you've got?

00:10:10.020 --> 00:10:11.770
Hair Needles!

00:10:13.360 --> 00:10:14.780
Too slow.

00:10:17.400 --> 00:10:18.630
You...!

00:10:18.630 --> 00:10:21.930
Allow me to properly introduce myself.

00:10:21.930 --> 00:10:25.640
La Seine the vampire is my name.

00:10:33.210 --> 00:10:36.030
Spirit Hair Chanchanko!

00:10:45.140 --> 00:10:46.160
Get off!

00:11:09.120 --> 00:11:10.420
That's...!

00:11:11.000 --> 00:11:13.210
And that ends that.

00:11:23.600 --> 00:11:29.020
For one who caused such trouble for
Backbeard-sama, this is disappointing.

00:11:33.480 --> 00:11:36.970
There wasn't much time to
get acquainted, but...

00:11:36.970 --> 00:11:39.510
Bye-bye, Kitaro.

00:11:39.510 --> 00:11:40.800
Mammoth.

00:11:40.800 --> 00:11:42.070
Yessir.

00:11:50.620 --> 00:11:54.150
That takes care of that pain in the neck.

00:11:54.840 --> 00:11:58.700
Let's gather blood for Backbeard-sama.

00:11:58.700 --> 00:12:00.150
Yessir.

00:12:05.680 --> 00:12:09.220
Kitaro said to leave it to him, but...

00:12:10.180 --> 00:12:13.520
I wonder if Cat-san's all right.

00:12:28.620 --> 00:12:31.310
La Seine-sama!

00:12:32.960 --> 00:12:35.130
Get off! Get off!

00:12:41.260 --> 00:12:43.550
What should we do with this?

00:12:49.470 --> 00:12:55.270
The punishment for harming
a proud noble like myself is severe.

00:12:56.060 --> 00:12:58.340
You're sentenced to the nail.

00:13:32.310 --> 00:13:34.540
You can't move now.

00:13:34.540 --> 00:13:36.810
I'll shred you.

00:13:42.730 --> 00:13:44.400
How about this?

00:13:46.150 --> 00:13:51.330
If you do too much and burn the board,
it'll attack again.

00:13:51.700 --> 00:13:53.060
Dammit!

00:13:53.060 --> 00:13:55.850
How about dissolving it with chemicals?

00:13:55.850 --> 00:14:00.900
And if only the board melts
it'll just attack us.

00:14:00.900 --> 00:14:02.300
Oh, right.

00:14:11.850 --> 00:14:14.330
Here should be good. Do it.

00:14:14.330 --> 00:14:15.520
Yessir.

00:14:19.440 --> 00:14:24.760
If that thing is still moving,
it means Kitaro is still alive.

00:14:24.760 --> 00:14:26.510
Let's finish him off.

00:14:26.510 --> 00:14:27.950
Yessir.

00:14:30.370 --> 00:14:31.430
Oomph!

00:14:31.910 --> 00:14:35.690
Oomph! Oomph!

00:14:35.690 --> 00:14:37.430
Oomph!

00:14:37.430 --> 00:14:39.250
Found it!

00:14:42.710 --> 00:14:47.070
I was foolish to think
sealing him away was enough.

00:14:50.890 --> 00:14:53.720
Now he can't stop us anymore!

00:14:54.220 --> 00:14:56.980
Too bad, Kitaro!

00:15:05.320 --> 00:15:07.180
D-Don't!

00:15:07.180 --> 00:15:08.590
Tremble.

00:15:08.590 --> 00:15:10.140
Plead.

00:15:10.140 --> 00:15:11.890
P-Please don't.

00:15:12.490 --> 00:15:16.890
Not every plea is answered.

00:15:23.590 --> 00:15:25.130
La Seine-sama!

00:15:34.220 --> 00:15:35.450
Dammit!

00:15:37.310 --> 00:15:38.770
How?!

00:15:39.100 --> 00:15:42.520
I nailed it and locked it up.

00:15:42.900 --> 00:15:45.790
This is just my theory, but...

00:15:45.790 --> 00:15:51.350
Hold it. Is your theory that
in a safe at the bottom of the night sea,

00:15:51.350 --> 00:15:55.220
a <i>chanchanko</i> that's been
nailed to a board

00:15:55.220 --> 00:16:01.270
struggled and managed to unravel a thread
that reached through a gap in the door,

00:16:01.270 --> 00:16:05.150
reaching the dial outside
and turning it to open the door

00:16:05.150 --> 00:16:07.900
letting it escape to the surface?!

00:16:07.900 --> 00:16:09.400
Exactly!

00:16:09.400 --> 00:16:11.160
That's impossible!

00:16:11.160 --> 00:16:14.580
But it's the only explanation.

00:16:14.580 --> 00:16:17.290
Kitaro's been obliterated.

00:16:17.290 --> 00:16:21.210
You saw me destroy the containment cube!

00:16:21.210 --> 00:16:27.420
Yessir, but perhaps that <i>chanchanko</i>
contains Kitaro's soul.

00:16:27.420 --> 00:16:32.300
Very well.
Let's go someplace he won't find us.

00:16:32.300 --> 00:16:33.430
Yessir.

00:16:39.330 --> 00:16:43.400
Even he won't think to find us here.

00:16:43.400 --> 00:16:46.280
What do we do now?

00:16:46.280 --> 00:16:50.700
Wait until things blow over
then maybe head to Osaka.

00:16:50.700 --> 00:16:53.260
That sounds good.

00:16:57.300 --> 00:16:59.240
The <i>chanchanko</i>...!

00:17:03.100 --> 00:17:05.290
Close off every single gap!

00:17:13.360 --> 00:17:16.640
That <i>chanchanko</i> can't get in now.

00:17:16.640 --> 00:17:17.820
Good.

00:17:23.750 --> 00:17:25.040
Where is it?!

00:17:34.130 --> 00:17:37.030
It's coming in through the chimney!

00:17:37.030 --> 00:17:38.200
Start a fire!

00:17:38.200 --> 00:17:39.080
Yessir!

00:17:39.080 --> 00:17:40.640
Oomph!

00:17:42.600 --> 00:17:44.600
More! Even more!

00:17:45.100 --> 00:17:46.790
More, more!

00:17:51.730 --> 00:17:54.070
La Seine-sama!

00:17:58.200 --> 00:17:59.720
Hurry up!

00:17:59.720 --> 00:18:01.810
It's jammed from the outside!

00:18:11.420 --> 00:18:13.400
What an ordeal!

00:18:13.400 --> 00:18:16.120
La Seine-sama, are you all right?

00:18:16.120 --> 00:18:18.390
Y... Yes.

00:18:19.930 --> 00:18:21.560
Kitaro...?!

00:18:22.260 --> 00:18:24.790
Mana rescued me.

00:18:26.390 --> 00:18:28.900
Mana dug up the containment cube,

00:18:29.310 --> 00:18:32.690
and Agnes undid it with remote magic.

00:18:33.610 --> 00:18:36.680
That traitor...!

00:18:36.680 --> 00:18:39.760
The cube you destroyed was a fake.

00:18:42.330 --> 00:18:44.020
I see.

00:18:44.020 --> 00:18:45.850
But have you forgotten?

00:18:46.910 --> 00:18:50.400
You already lost to me.

00:18:52.500 --> 00:18:54.530
I've already analyzed your movements.

00:18:54.530 --> 00:18:57.050
You dare make a fool of me?!

00:19:00.430 --> 00:19:01.890
Remote Controlled Geta!

00:19:05.470 --> 00:19:10.420
My beautiful-as-the-crescent-moon
slender fangs...

00:19:10.420 --> 00:19:11.880
That's enough.

00:19:11.880 --> 00:19:13.130
You've lost.

00:19:14.270 --> 00:19:17.590
Silence! This fight isn't over yet!

00:19:19.200 --> 00:19:21.260
Finger Guns!

00:19:23.580 --> 00:19:25.760
Mammoth, you...!

00:19:25.760 --> 00:19:28.100
We understand your power.

00:19:28.100 --> 00:19:31.570
We'll avoid Japan, so please forgive us!

00:19:31.570 --> 00:19:33.320
What are you saying?!

00:19:33.320 --> 00:19:37.820
We need blood to resurrect Backbeard-sama!

00:19:37.820 --> 00:19:42.280
Yes, but, it's better than
being eliminated here!

00:19:46.720 --> 00:19:49.410
We're begging you, Kitaro!

00:19:51.480 --> 00:19:53.480
You're too soft, Kitaro!

00:19:57.360 --> 00:19:59.190
Summon Bake-Bi!

00:20:00.400 --> 00:20:01.990
FIRE

00:20:36.480 --> 00:20:38.590
La Seine-sama!

00:20:41.400 --> 00:20:42.490
<i>On!</i>

00:20:43.780 --> 00:20:45.890
Rei Isurugi.

00:20:45.890 --> 00:20:47.580
Yo, Kitaro.

00:20:54.630 --> 00:20:56.280
From now on,

00:20:56.280 --> 00:21:02.260
you can live, suffering with the pain that
you've failed your master.

00:21:04.380 --> 00:21:06.350
Why kill La Seine?

00:21:06.720 --> 00:21:08.140
La Seine?

00:21:08.470 --> 00:21:11.250
Oh, so that's its name.

00:21:12.890 --> 00:21:17.250
I will kill any <i>yokai</i> that
would harm humans.

00:21:17.980 --> 00:21:22.150
But, good or evil, I will let humans live.

00:21:22.820 --> 00:21:25.260
The fight was already over.

00:21:25.610 --> 00:21:27.260
So what?

00:21:27.260 --> 00:21:31.600
Left alive, it'd only attack people
in some other country.

00:21:31.600 --> 00:21:34.160
Why hesitate to eliminate it?

00:21:34.870 --> 00:21:37.210
You can have that human.

00:21:38.340 --> 00:21:42.800
Judge or punish him as you like.

00:21:43.380 --> 00:21:45.130
Your softness...

00:21:45.970 --> 00:21:50.160
Someday, it's going to cost you dearly.

00:22:14.580 --> 00:22:17.750
<i>You're a dream
My dream</i>

00:22:14.580 --> 00:22:17.750
<i>kimi wa yume boku no yume</i>

00:22:17.880 --> 00:22:21.210
<i>I'm dreaming in a dream</i>

00:22:17.880 --> 00:22:21.210
<i>yume no naka de yume miteiru</i>

00:22:21.340 --> 00:22:24.720
<i>Let's stay like this forever</i>

00:22:21.340 --> 00:22:24.720
